 "definition": "A legal claim on a property that lets contractors and suppliers secure payment for work or materials they provided to it.",
 "description": {
  "text": "A mechanic's lien is a security interest in the title to property for the benefit of those who supplied labor or materials that improve it. It exists for both real and personal property; for real property it is also called a construction lien.",
